        <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip text-indigo-400"></i> 1. Processing Modes: Client-Side vs. Cloud AI
      </h2>
      <p>
        To ensure complete transparency, we categorize all utilities on this website into two distinct processing models:
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
