          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300">
            Tools like our <strong>JSON Formatter & Validator</strong>, <strong>Universal Unit Converter</strong>, <strong>QR Code Generator</strong>, and <strong>Image Compressor</strong> execute either directly in your browser's JavaScript engine (using the HTML5 Canvas API and Web APIs) or deterministically. Your images, JSON strings, and converted values are never stored or logged on our servers.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-indigo-400 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-robot"></i> Generative AI Tools
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300">
            Tools like our <strong>YouTube Title Generator</strong>, <strong>YouTube Description Generator</strong>, <strong>Hashtag Generator</strong>, and <strong>AI Text Generator</strong> send your user prompt over secure HTTPS (TLS 1.3) to our backend proxy and onward to top-tier AI providers (Groq, OpenRouter, Google Gemini) to generate text. The prompt is discarded immediately after the response is rendered. We do not store queries or associate them with personal accounts.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
